Even Mo' Bends licensing
========================

This repository is a mixed-license source tree.

- Code and assets inherited from Mo' Bends, plus fork-specific work not marked
  otherwise, are available under the MIT License. See LICENSES/MIT.txt.
- Files derived from Smart Moving are marked with
  `SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later` and are available under the GNU
  General Public License version 3 or later. See
  LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt.
- A file containing both MIT-licensed Mo' Bends material and Smart
  Moving-derived material is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later while
  retaining the original MIT copyright and permission notice.

Combined Even Mo' Bends binaries containing Smart Moving-derived code are
distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. This does not remove or restrict the MIT
license on source files that remain independently available under MIT.

Upstream authorship and exact source inputs are documented in UPSTREAM.md.
